# NER training artifacts: optimizer/scheduler/checkpoint state (~6 GB per
# model, ~18 GB total). Produced by scripts/train_*_ner.py and never read at
# runtime — the sidecar only loads `<model_dir>/model/`. Shipping these into
# the build context exhausts the Docker VM disk (ResourceExhausted on build).
secureprompt-ml/app/resources/*/trainer
**/checkpoint-*
